{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_3_level_main_03-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-04",
  "title": "亀裂",
  "storyCode": "3-4",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "66e2f0755e49598f506278aa384e0fe4fcfa95398155862515a0696c5c4bfa43",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十六关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "アーミヤ、どうだった？　ペンギン急便ってすっごいでしょ～？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい、とってもすごかったです！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "おっ、おお～う……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "自分より若い子に直球で褒められると、なんかちょっぴり照れちゃうなあ。へへっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "彼女は依頼主だぞ。礼儀をわきまえろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "おっと、ごめんなさ～い！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "いえ、お気になさらず。お二人には、感謝してもしきれないほどですし！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "そうか。ともあれ、これでロドスとは合流できたな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "次はどう動く？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今回は共同作戦ですし、まずは近衛局の判断を仰いでみましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "わかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "ならば、彼らにも合流を呼びかけてみよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この地形を見るに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "レユニオンは、あえて我々を誘い込んだのかもしれませんね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "荒れ地に広がる砂と岩……野外作戦にはうってつけの条件が揃ってるものね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ここに足りないものなんて、あとは敵影くらいじゃない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "――ホシグマ、お前にはロドスのサポートを頼む。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "なるほど？　了解です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "私は近衛局の部隊と共にポジションを移動する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "このまま膠着状態が続けば、レユニオンを見失ってしまう可能性もあるからな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "わかりました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "では、どうかお気をつけて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "――うんわあ～、それにしてもすっごい風！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "あーあー、視界最悪、何も見えないでありま～す……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "これ以上は進めそうにないわね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "レユニオンとしては、こっちが包囲網に入るのを待って仕掛けてくるつもりなのかも。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "だけど、思い通りにはさせられないね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "それじゃ、こうしましょうか。――アーミヤ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "あたしとリスカムたちで迂回して、敵方を偵察しつつ、高台に陣取れないかやってみるわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "だから、こっちから連絡を入れるまで、ほかのみんなにはここで待機しててほしいの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "もちろん、私たちがどんなに派手にやりあってようと、飛び出してきちゃダメよ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "わかりました。とはいえ、状況に合わせて判断しますね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "はいはい。ドクター、あなたもちゃ～んと見ててあげてね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "それでは、また後ほどご連絡します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "この辺りには誰もいないみたい。高台を守ってる様子もないし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "まったく、お笑いぐさね。レユニオンにはまともな指揮官がいないのかしら？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "というと……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ここはどう見ても、守りやすくて攻めにくい地形なのよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "つまりあたしならここに伏兵を置くけど、あの連中ときたら――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "――かかったな！　死ねっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "あ～あ、言ったそばから……恥かかせないでちょうだい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――フランカさんっ！　側面にも注意してください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "建物の下に、レユニオンが――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "ぐっ……た、太刀筋が、見えない……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "どう……して……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ふふっ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "そこに隠れれば、足元から奇襲できるとでも思ってたの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "だとしたら、あたしをちょっと甘く見すぎじゃないかしら。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "……く、そっ……ブラック……スチール……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "っ、退却だ！　全員、撤退しろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "やれやれね。レユニオンが大勢待ち構えてるだろうと思って、こっちも慎重に進んできたのに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "待ってたのは小物のザコばっかりなんて、正直がっかりだわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "がっかりしてる場合じゃないよ、フランカ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "そう簡単に逃がすわけにもいかないでしょ。追いかけないと！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "アーミヤさん、追跡の許可をお願いできますか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "いえ、やはりここは堅実に。リスクは回避して動きましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "まずはペンギン急便のお二人にお願いして、態勢を整えてから行動すべきだと思います。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "エクシアさん、高台の確保を優先してもらってもいいですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "りょうか～い！　今すぐ行ってこよっか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい。できる限り、牽制もお願いできると嬉しいです。レユニオンに反撃の機会を与えないようにしたいので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "――待った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "あの連中、一度退いた先で陣形を立て直しているようだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "それに……先ほどは見なかった人員を連れている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "注意してください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あの人たちは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "普通の戦闘員ではありません！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "どうして、レユニオンに彼らの姿が……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "……あれって、もしかして……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "もしかして、何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "……あっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "まさか……あの構成員たちは、サルカズ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "恐らく、そうかと……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（小声）リスカムさん。今は近衛局との共同作戦中ですから、こうしたデリケートな問題に触れることは避けておきましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "（小声）了解しました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（小声）ありがとうございます。私の推測については、また改めてお話ししますので！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……構えろ。来るぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい！　みなさん、準備をお願いします！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今回は……厳しい戦いになりそうですから！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
